<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Vértice — Academia de Matemática</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#F7F8FA;
    --surface:#FFFFFF;
    --ink:#14213D;
    --ink-soft:#4A567A;
    --ink-faint:#8891A8;
    --accent:#E7A339;
    --accent-ink:#5C4413;
    --line:#DCE1EA;
    --line-strong:#B9C2D4;
    --max:1180px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    position:relative;
  }

  /* graph-paper texture, subtle, throughout the page */
  body::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:40px 40px;
    opacity:0.35;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:0;
  }

  .wrap{max-width:var(--max); margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px; position:relative; z-index:1;}

  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}

  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;}

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(247,248,250,0.88);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:20px 32px;
    max-width:var(--max); margin:0 auto;
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1.25rem;
  }
  .brand-mark{
    width:30px; height:30px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .nav-links{
    display:flex; gap:36px; align-items:center;
    font-size:0.94rem; font-weight:500; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .nav-links a{transition:color .15s ease;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    padding:11px 22px;
    border-radius:3px;
    font-weight:600; font-size:0.92rem;
    border:1.5px solid var(--ink);
    transition:all .15s ease;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent-ink);}
  .btn-ghost{
    border-color:var(--line-strong); color:var(--ink);
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink);}
  .menu-toggle{display:none; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; padding:4px;}
  .menu-toggle svg{width:26px; height:26px;}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:88px 0 60px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom:22px;
    padding:6px 12px 6px 6px;
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius:20px;
    width:fit-content;
  }
  .eyebrow-dot{
    width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent);
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:3.4rem;
    line-height:1.06;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:normal;
    color:var(--accent-ink);
    background:linear-gradient(transparent 62%, var(--accent) 62%);
  }
  .hero p.lead{
    font-size:1.12rem;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    max-width:480px;
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  .hero-actions{display:flex; gap:14px; margin-bottom:40px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-proof{
    display:flex; gap:28px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .proof-item{
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px;
  }
  .proof-num{font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1.5rem;}
  .proof-label{font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--ink-faint);}

  .hero-graph{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:20px;
  }
  .hero-graph-label{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:0.72rem;
    color:var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom:6px; letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }

  /* ---------- section shared ---------- */
  section{padding:88px 0;}
  .section-head{
    max-width:600px;
    margin-bottom:52px;
  }
  .section-tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent-ink);
    margin-bottom:10px;
    display:block;
  }
  .section-head h2{font-size:2.2rem; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .section-head p{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:1.02rem;}

  .divider{
    border:none; border-top:1px solid var(--line); margin:0;
  }

  /* ---------- courses ---------- */
  .course-track{
    position:relative;
    margin-bottom:44px;
    padding:18px 0 0;
  }
  .course-track svg{width:100%; height:auto; display:block;}

  .courses-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--line);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:6px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .course-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    padding:28px 24px;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;
    transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  .course-card:hover{background:#FBFCFE;}
  .course-level{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.74rem; color:var(--ink-faint);
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
  }
  .course-level .dot{
    width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--accent);
  }
  .course-card h3{font-size:1.18rem; margin-bottom:2px; line-height:1.25;}
  .course-age{font-size:0.84rem; color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .course-desc{font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--ink-soft); flex-grow:1;}
  .course-foot{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding-top:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .course-price{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem;}
  .course-price span{font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--ink-faint); font-weight:400;}
  .course-link{font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--accent-ink);}

  /* ---------- materials ---------- */
  .materials-list{
    display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .material-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:64px 1fr auto auto;
    gap:20px;
    align-items:center;
    padding:22px 4px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  .material-row:hover{background:rgba(231,163,57,0.06);}
  .material-icon{
    width:44px; height:44px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius:6px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.68rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .material-info h3{font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:600; font-family:'Inter'; margin-bottom:3px;}
  .material-info p{font-size:0.86rem; color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .material-tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding:4px 10px; border-radius:20px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .material-download{
    font-size:0.86rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink);
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  }
  .material-download svg{width:16px; height:16px;}

  /* ---------- about strip ---------- */
  .about{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
  }
  .about .wrap{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .about h2{color:var(--paper); font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .about p{color:#B8C0D6; font-size:1.02rem; margin-bottom:24px;}
  .about-list{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px;}
  .about-item{
    display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start;
    padding-bottom:16px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }
  .about-item:last-child{border-bottom:none; padding-bottom:0;}
  .about-num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; color:var(--accent); font-size:0.85rem; padding-top:3px;
  }
  .about-item h4{font-family:'Inter'; font-weight:600; font-size:1rem; color:var(--paper); margin-bottom:4px;}
  .about-item p{color:#9AA4BE; font-size:0.88rem; margin:0;}

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */
  .contact{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:52px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:48px;
  }
  .contact h2{font-size:1.9rem; margin-bottom:12px;}
  .contact p{color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:24px;}
  .contact-detail{
    display:flex; gap:12px; margin-bottom:14px; font-size:0.92rem;
  }
  .contact-detail strong{font-weight:600; min-width:78px; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:0.8rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em; padding-top:2px;}
  .form-field{margin-bottom:16px;}
  .form-field label{
    display:block; font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom:6px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }
  .form-field input, .form-field select{
    width:100%; padding:12px 14px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius:4px;
    font-family:'Inter'; font-size:0.95rem;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .form-field input:focus, .form-field select:focus{
    outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:1px; border-color:var(--accent);
  }
  .contact form .btn{width:100%; justify-content:center; margin-top:6px; cursor:pointer;}

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:36px 0;
  }
  footer .wrap{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px;
  }
  .footer-brand{font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:600;}
  .footer-links{display:flex; gap:24px; font-size:0.86rem; color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .footer-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  /* ---------- reveal animation ---------- */
  .reveal{
    opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);
    transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease;
  }
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:none;}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .reveal{transition:none; opacity:1; transform:none;}
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
  }

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .courses-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .about .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .contact{grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:36px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:720px){
    .nav-links{display:none;}
    .menu-toggle{display:block;}
    .hero h1{font-size:2.3rem;}
    .hero{padding:48px 0 40px;}
    section{padding:56px 0;}
    .courses-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .material-row{grid-template-columns:44px 1fr; row-gap:10px;}
    .material-row .material-tag, .material-row .material-download{grid-column:2;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="brand-mark">
        <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none">
          <rect x="1" y="1" width="28" height="28" rx="4" stroke="#14213D" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <path d="M8 21L14 10L18 17L22 9" stroke="#E7A339" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      Vértice
    </div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#cursos">Cursos</a>
      <a href="#materiales">Materiales</a>
      <a href="#nosotros">Nosotros</a>
      <a href="#contacto">Contacto</a>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center;">
      <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">Clase de prueba</a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Abrir menú">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#14213D" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>Academia de matemática · Lima</span>
        <h1>Entender el problema<br>antes de <em>resolverlo</em>.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Clases de matemática desde primaria hasta preparación para el examen de admisión. Grupos pequeños, material propio y un profesor que explica el porqué, no solo el cómo.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">Reservar clase de prueba</a>
          <a href="#cursos" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver cursos</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof">
          <div class="proof-item">
            <span class="proof-num mono">12</span>
            <span class="proof-label">años enseñando</span>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-item">
            <span class="proof-num mono">94%</span>
            <span class="proof-label">aprueba su examen de admisión</span>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-item">
            <span class="proof-num mono">6</span>
            <span class="proof-label">alumnos por grupo, máximo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-graph reveal">
        <div class="hero-graph-label">
          <span>f(x) — progreso del alumno</span>
          <span>MAT · 2026</span>
        </div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 420 320" width="100%" height="auto">
          <!-- axes -->
          <line x1="40" y1="270" x2="400" y2="270" stroke="#B9C2D4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="40" y1="270" x2="40" y2="20" stroke="#B9C2D4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <!-- tick grid -->
          <g stroke="#DCE1EA" stroke-width="1">
            <line x1="112" y1="270" x2="112" y2="20"/>
            <line x1="184" y1="270" x2="184" y2="20"/>
            <line x1="256" y1="270" x2="256" y2="20"/>
            <line x1="328" y1="270" x2="328" y2="20"/>
          </g>
          <!-- curve -->
          <path id="curve" d="M50 250 C 120 245, 160 220, 200 175 C 250 120, 290 90, 380 45"
                fill="none" stroke="#14213D" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <!-- points at course levels -->
          <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="10" fill="#4A567A">
            <circle cx="56" cy="248" r="5" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#14213D" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="46" y="288">Primaria</text>

            <circle cx="150" cy="228" r="5" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#14213D" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="128" y="288">Secundaria</text>

            <circle cx="260" cy="118" r="5" fill="#E7A339" stroke="#14213D" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="228" y="105">Preuniversitario</text>

            <circle cx="378" cy="46" r="6" fill="#E7A339" stroke="#14213D" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <text x="326" y="34">Admisión ✓</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <section id="cursos">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Cursos</span>
        <h2>Un curso para cada etapa</h2>
        <p>Los grupos avanzan por nivel, no por edad exacta: ubicamos a cada alumno según lo que ya domina, con una evaluación diagnóstica gratuita antes de empezar.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="courses-grid reveal">
        <div class="course-card">
          <div class="course-level"><span class="mono">MAT-P1</span><span class="dot"></span></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Fundamentos numéricos</h3>
            <span class="course-age">Primaria · 6 a 11 años</span>
          </div>
          <p class="course-desc">Operaciones, fracciones y razonamiento lógico con material manipulativo.</p>
          <div class="course-foot">
            <span class="course-price">S/ 130<span>/mes</span></span>
            <a href="#contacto" class="course-link">Inscribirme →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="course-card">
          <div class="course-level"><span class="mono">MAT-S2</span><span class="dot"></span></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Álgebra y geometría</h3>
            <span class="course-age">Secundaria · 12 a 16 años</span>
          </div>
          <p class="course-desc">Ecuaciones, funciones y geometría plana, con refuerzo de tareas del colegio.</p>
          <div class="course-foot">
            <span class="course-price">S/ 160<span>/mes</span></span>
            <a href="#contacto" class="course-link">Inscribirme →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="course-card">
          <div class="course-level"><span class="mono">MAT-U3</span><span class="dot"></span></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Cálculo y trigonometría</h3>
            <span class="course-age">Preuniversitario · 16 a 18 años</span>
          </div>
          <p class="course-desc">Límites, derivadas y trigonometría, orientado a exámenes de admisión.</p>
          <div class="course-foot">
            <span class="course-price">S/ 210<span>/mes</span></span>
            <a href="#contacto" class="course-link">Inscribirme →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="course-card">
          <div class="course-level"><span class="mono">MAT-R5</span><span class="dot"></span></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Reforzamiento personalizado</h3>
            <span class="course-age">Todas las edades · 1 a 1</span>
          </div>
          <p class="course-desc">Sesiones individuales para cerrar brechas específicas antes de un examen.</p>
          <div class="course-foot">
            <span class="course-price">S/ 60<span>/sesión</span></span>
            <a href="#contacto" class="course-link">Inscribirme →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <section id="materiales">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Materiales</span>
        <h2>Todo el material, en un solo lugar</h2>
        <p>Guías, formularios y simulacros que usamos en clase. Los alumnos matriculados acceden a la versión completa; aquí puedes revisar una muestra.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="materials-list reveal">
        <div class="material-row">
          <div class="material-icon">PDF</div>
          <div class="material-info">
            <h3>Guía de fracciones y decimales</h3>
            <p>32 ejercicios resueltos paso a paso · Nivel primaria</p>
          </div>
          <span class="material-tag">6 páginas</span>
          <a href="#" class="material-download">Descargar
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v13m0 0l-5-5m5 5l5-5M4 21h16" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="material-row">
          <div class="material-icon">PDF</div>
          <div class="material-info">
            <h3>Formulario de álgebra y geometría</h3>
            <p>Fórmulas clave para exámenes de secundaria</p>
          </div>
          <span class="material-tag">2 páginas</span>
          <a href="#" class="material-download">Descargar
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v13m0 0l-5-5m5 5l5-5M4 21h16" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="material-row">
          <div class="material-icon">VID</div>
          <div class="material-info">
            <h3>Videoclase: límites y continuidad</h3>
            <p>Grabación de clase en vivo con ejercicios comentados</p>
          </div>
          <span class="material-tag">48 min</span>
          <a href="#" class="material-download">Ver clase
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v13m0 0l-5-5m5 5l5-5M4 21h16" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="material-row">
          <div class="material-icon">PDF</div>
          <div class="material-info">
            <h3>Simulacro de examen de admisión</h3>
